00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:05,165
Drip 1. A coffee stand, in 5 steps.

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:10,833
Check your parts. 6 pieces, 4 screws, 1 key.

3
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:19,450
Step 1. Set the pole in the base. Turn both screws until they click.

4
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:27,704
Step 2. Slide the arm down the pole. Hold the base steady, and tighten the knob.

5
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:35,862
Step 3. Ring on the arm, notch facing down. 2 screws.

6
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:40,919
Step 4. Lower the cone into the ring.

7
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:45,477
Step 5. Slide the carafe underneath.

8
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:51,521
Done. Time for coffee.
